{
  "title": "Tablor",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "2-osc wavetable",
        "synth. 8 voices",
        "poly or mono.",
        "",
        "2 wavetable oscs,",
        "sub, noise, multi-",
        "mode filter, two",
        "envelopes, 2 LFOs,",
        "4-slot mod matrix,",
        "8 user macros.",
        "",
        "Based on Wavetable",
        "by Roland Rabien",
        "(FigBug), BSD-3."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Wavetables",
      "lines": [
        "Tables live in",
        "UserLibrary/",
        " Wavetables.",
        "",
        "Drop .wav files",
        "there via Move",
        "Manager or the",
        "schwung manager.",
        "",
        "Serum, Vital and",
        "Ableton exports",
        "work (frame size",
        "auto-detected).",
        "",
        "115 factory tables",
        "are seeded on",
        "first run.",
        "",
        "On the OSC page,",
        "turn knobs 1/2 to",
        "step tables, or",
        "click to browse",
        "with live preview."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "lines": [
        "Stock Schwung UI:",
        "jog scrolls, click",
        "opens, Back goes",
        "up. Knobs 1-8 play",
        "the open page.",
        "",
        "Envelopes, filter",
        "and LFOs draw as",
        "live graphics.",
        "",
        "Root: oscillators",
        " (tables, pos,",
        " level, tune)",
        "Presets: browser",
        "Unison / Shape",
        "Filter: cutoff,",
        " res, type, sub,",
        " noise",
        "Env / Env+",
        "LFO 1 / LFO 2",
        "Mod 1-2 / 3-4",
        "Global",
        "User + U.Map:",
        " 8 macros"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "User Macros",
      "lines": [
        "8 knobs you map",
        "to anything.",
        "",
        "On U.MAP, pick a",
        "target for each",
        "macro. On USER,",
        "play them.",
        "",
        "Macros save with",
        "the patch and can",
        "be automated."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Presets",
      "lines": [
        "'Presets' is the",
        "first item — click",
        "it for the full",
        "preset list.",
        "",
        "Save Preset knob:",
        "flick it On to",
        "save your sound",
        "(current user",
        "preset, or a new",
        "'Untitled').",
        "",
        "Rename: opens the",
        "on-screen keyboard",
        "and renames the",
        "preset's file.",
        "",
        "Your sounds are",
        ".tblr files in",
        "UserLibrary/",
        " Tablor Presets —",
        "copy and share",
        "them freely.",
        "",
        "8 factory sounds",
        "ship built in."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "MIDI",
      "lines": [
        "Notes, velocity,",
        "pitch bend (range",
        "on GLOBAL page),",
        "mod wheel (CC 1),",
        "sustain (CC 64),",
        "aftertouch.",
        "",
        "Mod wheel, after-",
        "touch and pitch",
        "bend are also mod",
        "matrix sources."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Credits",
      "lines": [
        "Sound engine after",
        "Wavetable + gin by",
        "Roland Rabien",
        "(BSD-3).",
        "",
        "Filter DSP:",
        "AudioFilter (MZTi).",
        "FLAC: dr_flac.",
        "Pink noise: Thomas",
        "Merchant (MIT).",
        "",
        "Wavetables:",
        "Adventure Kid",
        "(AKWF, public",
        "domain) and Neu",
        "KatalYst (free).",
        "",
        "Port for Schwung:",
        "athousanddetails."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
